  {
    "hotel_id": "789417",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/kalya-hotel-bandung/hotel/bandung-id.html",
    "name": "Kalya Hotel Bandung Dago",
    "detail": "I use this hotel for attending my graduation which held in Sabuga ITB, it was so near that you could just walk since the traffic was worst. It located at Sumur Bandung St, and new social bar just opened right in front of it, named KIRI. Kiri has such a chill vibes and good chill music, but not so much has club music or big dance floor. The hotel room was good, not too fancy since this is budget hotel, and when peak season it is not that cheap either with no restaurant or room service or swimming pool. It is just a hotel, like bed and breakfast even. So if you tend to get hungry at night, I recommend you just buy things from outside. The room was clean and the receptionist will help you basically with anything, like if you're foreigner they can help you to book taxi and stuffs, but speak english slowly since the most fluent one is just like one person. Good experience.",
